# The Cover: what an empty document's viewport shows, and its disappearance when the first part is added.
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive crates/bowshock/scripts/cover.drive out/cover
viewport 1280x800

# Empty start: the mark large on the viewport ground, the label, the quiet hint under it.
screenshot Cover-empty.png

# Light theme.
click "Light"
screenshot Cover-light.png
click "Dark"

# Adding the first part (click = attach): the Cover is gone and the viewport shows the model on its sheet.
click "Nose cone"
screenshot Cover-nose.png
